            <title>[IGNITE-620] Add CI tooling code for patch validation</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-620</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;The code for automatic patch validation in public TC is pretty much ready. It needs to be added to the Ignite source code repo to facilitate the completion of the project.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Without adding the code in we&apos;ll have to resort to manage a separate repo for projects like that and deal with multiple repo builds, which might be messy at times.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
